^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
\s*// 28 no location\n\s*CALL java::Other\.<clinit_wrapper>\(\)\s*// 29 no location\s*CALL java::Third\.<clinit_wrapper>\(\)\s*// 30 no location\s*DECL .*::total
